    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for epiphany fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in epiphany:\n\n- CVE-2026-77679: path traversal in WebExtension XPI extraction\n    (ZIP slip) (bsc#1276758)\n- CVE-2026-77682: JavaScript code injection in autofill via\n  unsanitized CSS selector from element id (bsc#1275932)\n",
